WEBVTT

brief-1
00:00:01.294 --> 00:00:03.504
Paste your client's brief on the home page. No signup.

brief-2
00:00:03.554 --> 00:00:05.764
Pick your rate and buffer, then run the AI estimate.

estimate-1
00:00:05.814 --> 00:00:08.447
The AI breaks the brief into features, user stories and hours.

estimate-2
00:00:08.497 --> 00:00:11.130
Price = hours × your rate + buffer. The AI never sets the price.

project-1
00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:18.039
Save the estimate into a project for your client.

agreement-1
00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:23.319
One click turns it into an agreement: sections, terms and a 50/50 payment schedule.

agreement-2
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:28.600
Preview it, then create a sealed link for your client.

client-1
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:38.345
Your client opens the link, accepts each line and signs. No account needed.

client-2
00:00:38.395 --> 00:00:48.090
Both of you get a receipt with the document's fingerprint.

payment-1
00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:53.120
Request the deposit with your PromptPay or bank details.

payment-2
00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:58.149
Your client pays you directly. SignedScope never holds the money.
